	//  3. Primary and Not Protected. Path is also a Backup.
	//     => PathId is mandatory. ProtectedPathBitmap = 0xYYYY
	//  4. Primary and Protected. Path is also a Backup.
	//     => PathId is mandatory. ProtectedPathBitmap = 0xYYYY
	//  5. Pure Backup. Protection is not allowed for backup paths.
	//     => PathId is mandatory. ProtectedPathBitmap = 0xYYYY
